Superintendent

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:15.560
<Today's operation have ended.> 20.21

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:13.630
Hello?

00:20:13.630 --> 00:20:14.760
Ms. Superintendent?

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:26.530
is over~~~ Bye-bye

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:26.530
It's over!!

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:26.530
Let's go do fireworks at the pool!

00:20:40.490 --> 00:20:43.100
Ah, wait, ahh!

00:20:43.100 --> 00:20:44.770
Hey, come on, come on!

00:20:51.320 --> 00:20:53.020
Take this and this!

00:20:55.240 --> 00:20:56.830
Gosh...

00:20:59.370 --> 00:21:00.740
Hey, don't fight it!

00:21:06.010 --> 00:21:07.520
Why you!

00:21:08.140 --> 00:21:10.380
You come on in, too, Mikan-chan!

00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:13.010
I-I'm okay.

00:21:20.200 --> 00:21:21.450
Good gosh.

00:21:35.670 --> 00:21:36.850
Somehow...

00:21:37.280 --> 00:21:41.280
I felt as though I was still watching a dream.

00:21:42.130 --> 00:21:43.010
But...

00:21:43.810 --> 00:21:45.830
...this wasn't a dream,

00:21:46.160 --> 00:21:48.370
and I thought it would go on forever.

00:21:49.090 --> 00:21:50.420
And when I thought of that...

00:21:51.880 --> 00:21:55.120
...I just got so happy and happy...

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:56.360
...and couldn't hold in my feelings!

00:22:12.000 --> 00:22:17.300
We're still at the very beginning of things.

00:22:19.190 --> 00:22:24.050
Even the thousand-mile road starts with a first step.

00:22:26.660 --> 00:22:30.980
There's a first time for everyone,

00:22:31.190 --> 00:22:38.520
so take it on fearlessly - that's the best way to go

00:22:40.840 --> 00:22:47.800
I'm glad I chose a path I love,

00:22:48.000 --> 00:22:55.010
so thank you, God.

00:22:57.820 --> 00:23:03.310
I want to treasure my luck right now

00:23:03.530 --> 00:23:06.610
And stay happy on the way.

00:23:06.810 --> 00:23:10.450
Come on, let's ride on the momentum

00:23:10.710 --> 00:23:13.240
Bang！Bang！Bang！

00:23:13.300 --> 00:23:15.410
That's right, Lucky!

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:19.000
Now is the time, happy!

00:23:19.060 --> 00:23:22.130
Grab your chances

00:23:22.210 --> 00:23:27.300
And live your lives to the fullest...

00:23:39.810 --> 00:23:46.610
Episode 8 - Seioh Student Council, to Fight!
